"欢迎社区开发者和贡献者为 UniSDK 项目贡献代码、文档、示例和问题报告。"

#: ../../source/contribute/index.md:10
msgid ""
"**Note on SDK code contributions**: This guide focuses on the **unisdk-"
"doc** documentation repository. For SDK code contributions (unisdk), "
"please refer to the [unisdk repository](https://github.com/telink-"
"semi/unisdk)."
