"**关于 SDK 代码贡献的说明**：本指南主要针对 **unisdk-doc** 文档仓库。有关 SDK 代码贡献（unisdk），"
"请参考 [unisdk 仓库](https://github.com/telink-semi/unisdk)。"

#: ../../source/contribute/index.md:14
msgid "Documentation Repository: unisdk-doc"
msgstr "文档仓库：unisdk-doc"

#: ../../source/contribute/index.md:16
msgid ""
"The documentation repository ([unisdk-doc](https://github.com/telink-semi"
"/unisdk-doc)) follows the same branch model as the SDK code repository."
msgstr ""
"文档仓库（[unisdk-doc](https://github.com/telink-semi/unisdk-doc)）采用与 SDK 代码仓库相同的分支模型。"

